From d24b8a23a19a5fa0acc5c15badaaa31dc57462cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Iggy <iggy@triform.ai>
Date: Fri, 1 May 2026 08:48:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] cloud-browser: include video_encoder_factory.h in
 content_browser_client.cc

Patch 0001 added GetWebRtcVideoEncoderFactory() returning a
std::unique_ptr<webrtc::VideoEncoderFactory>. The default-deleter
instantiation in the .cc needs sizeof(VideoEncoderFactory), which
requires the full type. The forward declaration in the .h is fine
for the decl but the .cc needs the include.

Authored as a separate patch on top of 0001 because git-am 3-way
merge proved fragile when re-rolling 0001 with this addition baked
in (Wall #35).
---
 content/public/browser/content_browser_client.cc | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/content/public/browser/content_browser_client.cc b/content/public/browser/content_browser_client.cc
index 5c72f6a34e..66d1fd1ce9 100644
--- a/content/public/browser/content_browser_client.cc
+++ b/content/public/browser/content_browser_client.cc
@@ -93,6 +93,7 @@
 #include "third_party/blink/public/mojom/file_system_access/file_system_access_error.mojom.h"
 #include "third_party/blink/public/mojom/origin_trials/origin_trials_settings.mojom.h"
 #include "third_party/blink/public/mojom/payments/secure_payment_confirmation_service.mojom.h"
+#include "third_party/webrtc/api/video_codecs/video_encoder_factory.h"
 #include "ui/base/clipboard/clipboard_metadata.h"
 #include "ui/gfx/image/image_skia.h"
 #include "ui/shell_dialogs/select_file_policy.h"
-- 
